source_status = "PUBLIC: system designation and broad role; see docs/REALISM.md. GAMEPLAY_ESTIMATE: every range, gain and classification figure here is a tuning value, not a performance claim. Stands in for an older-generation dipping set: shorter reach than a modern array and slower to classify."
